          ]
        },
        {
          "number": "1.5",
          "title": "Overview of the document",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "paragraphs": [
                "Say how the document is organised. «Overall description» gives the context, «Specific requirements» lists what the service must do, and the chapters after it cover quality, verification and outputs."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": "2",
      "title": "Overall description",
      "sections": [
        {
          "number": "2.1",
          "title": "Product perspective",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "paragraphs": [
                "Say where the service sits: the portal it is used from, the back office that handles requests and the systems it exchanges data with."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "number": "2.2",
          "title": "Product functions",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "paragraphs": [
                "List the main functions in five lines at most. The detail belongs in «Specific requirements»."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "number": "2.3",
          "title": "User characteristics",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "paragraphs": [
                "Describe each user group: what it does with the service, how experienced it is and how it signs in."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "number": "2.4",
          "title": "Constraints",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "paragraphs": [
                "State what limits the design: legislation, fixed technology, hosting and deadlines."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "number": "2.5",
          "title": "Assumptions and dependencies",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "paragraphs": [
                "State what you assume to be true and what the service depends on. If an assumption fails, say which requirement changes."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
